case: active (source mode ACTIVE)

The plain baseline: the mode every other case is a deviation from.

Pins that ACTIVE resolves to POWER_STATE_ON + FUNCTIONAL_MODE_ACTIVE +
HEALTH_STATE_NOMINAL -- all three axes populated, none of them borrowed
from another axis.

It exists mainly so the conformance stage has an unambiguous positive:
if this case fails to encode, the failure is in the specimen's spine and
not in one of the edge modes.
